helpers/tree.py is a Python port of the coalescent simulation in kpop.c, by
Iain Mathieson, which describes itself as a direct port of Gil McVean's R code.
It was rewritten and changed from the original.
Original work: Copyright 2011 Iain Mathieson, Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).

If you use this code, please also cite the paper that kpop.c accompanies:
Mathieson I, McVean G. Differential confounding of rare and common variants in
spatially structured populations. Nature Genetics, 2012.
